  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "いかりのボルテージが　りんかいてんをこえたとき　にくたいという　わくにしばられない　パワーを　てにいれた。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "분노의 볼티지가 임계점을 돌파하면서 육체라는 틀에 얽매이지 않는 파워를 손에 넣게 되었다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "在怒氣突破臨界點時，獲得了能夠擺脫肉體束縛的力量。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Quand sa colère a franchi un seuil critique, il a acquis une puissance qui l’a émancipé des limites de son corps.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Als sein geballter Zorn einen kritischen Punkt überschritt, erlangte es Macht, die weit über die Grenzen seines physischen Körpers hinausgeht.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuando su ira explosiva rebasó el punto crítico, adquirió un poder que lo libró para siempre de las limitaciones de su cuerpo material.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Superando i livelli critici di rabbia, ha ottenuto il potere di andare oltre i vincoli del suo corpo fisico.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "When its anger rose beyond a critical point, this Pokémon gained power that is unfettered by the limits of its physical body.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "怒りのボルテージが　臨界点を超えたとき　肉体という　枠に縛られない　パワーを　手に入れた。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "当怒气突破临界点时，它获得了能够摆脱肉体束缚的力量。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuando su ira explosiva rebasó el punto crítico, adquirió un poder que lo libró para siempre de las limitaciones de su cuerpo material.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "こころに　ひめた　いかりのパワーをこぶしに　こめて　たたきつけるとあいてを　ほねのずいから　くだく。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "마음속에 감춰 둔 분노의 파워를 주먹에 담아 날려서 상대를 뼛속까지 바스러뜨린다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會將隱藏在心中的憤怒之力注入拳頭發動攻擊，其威力會深入骨髓，將對手打個粉碎。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il anéantit ses adversaires en leur assénant des coups de poing animés par la rage enfouie tout au fond de lui.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es leitet den geballten Zorn, den es tief im Herzen trägt, in seine Fäuste. Wenn es zuschlägt, erschüttert es seinen Gegner bis ins Mark.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Machaca sin piedad a sus rivales concentrando en los puños hasta el último ápice de ira albergada en su corazón.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Carica i pugni con tutta la forza della sua ira repressa e tempesta di colpi gli avversari riducendoli in poltiglia.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It imbues its fists with the power of the rage that it kept hidden in its heart. Opponents struck by these imbued fists will be shattered to their core.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "心に　秘めた　怒りのパワーをこぶしに　込めて　叩きつけると相手を　骨の髄から　砕く。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "会将隐藏在心里的愤怒之情凝聚在拳头里，其威力能深入对手骨髓，使其粉碎。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
